X:1
T:A Hymn of Glory Let Us Sing
T:LASST UNS ERFREUEN
C:Music: from Geistliche Kirchengesäng, Köln, 1623 · Words: The Venerable Bede, 735. Translation composite of Elizabeth Rundle Charles, 1858 and Benjamin Webb, 1854
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: 'Lutheran Worship' Hymnal, 1982 Hymn 436. Lyrics source: Composite from "A Collection of Hymns: Supplementary to the Psalms and Hymns of Dr. Watts", 1859 hymn 8. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/lasst_uns_erfreuen): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
